  "summary": "All five patients are reconciled per RBC-TOC-02. Each has a progress note, and four have a correction note after results or addenda arrived while I worked (§8).\n\nWalter Kim:\n- Furosemide changed to 40 mg twice daily (signed addendum).\n- Potassium chloride stopped (discharge summary).\n- Pantoprazole not ordered: it was a hospital formulary swap, so he stays on omeprazole.\n- Lisinopril: I first kept it on hold because potassium was 5.4 on 10/21. A repeat panel on 10/23 (K 4.7, creatinine 1.21) met the discharge condition, so I resumed it. My earlier follow-up task, task-t0003, is no longer needed, but the system wouldn't let me cancel it. Please close it.\n- An unsigned draft addendum proposing furosemide 60 mg twice daily changed nothing.\n\nTerence Stark:\n- Carvedilol: I raised it to 12.5 mg twice daily from the discharge summary. A signed addendum then reversed that (heart rate 48–52, lightheaded on standing), so it is back to 6.25 mg twice daily.\n- Flag: atorvastatin 80 mg fills cover only about 24% of the 180 days before admission. No change made; message sent.\n- Flag: glipizide 5 mg from Dr. Desai (outside pharmacy, no clinic order) isn't mentioned at discharge. Nothing ordered; message sent.\n\nEarnest Roberts:\n- Lisinopril: I resumed it on the 10/22 panel (creatinine 1.08, K 4.6). A potassium of 5.5 on 10/23 came in afterwards, so it is back on hold. Follow-up task for you due 10/26.\n- Insulins and rosuvastatin unchanged.\n\nGerald Whitcomb:\n- Lisinopril: I resumed it on the 10/21 labs (creatinine 1.12, K 4.4). The potassium drawn 10/22 then came back at 5.4, so it is back on hold. Follow-up task for you due 10/26.\n- Amlodipine and atorvastatin unchanged.\n\nLorraine Pruitt:\n- Metformin ER stays on hold. The only creatinine (1.21) is from the hospital stay, and the discharge condition needs a post-discharge result. Follow-up task for you due 10/24, when that panel is expected.\n- Amlodipine and atorvastatin unchanged.\n\nAll five new inbox items for these patients are closed, and nothing else new has arrived. Your other inbox items are untouched.",
